  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><span aria-current=\"page\">Insights</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Insights</p>\n        <h1>Guides written by the people who review the releases.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">No thought-leadership filler. Each guide is written or reviewed by a PressCosmos editor and reflects what we actually do when a release crosses our desk.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"resources.html\">Browse the resource library</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"rss.xml\">RSS feed</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  The PressCosmos insights library publishes practical guides on press release writing, SEO PR, AI answer-engine optimisation (AEO, GEO, LLMO), distribution pricing and media measurement. All guides are maintained and updated by our editorial team.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"card-grid\">\n    \n<article class=\"card story spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  <a class=\"story-art\" href=\"how-to-write-a-press-release.html\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 225\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"a2-14\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"225\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#22d3ee\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#a3e635\"/></linearGradient></defs><g stroke=\"url(#a2-14)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".8\"><path d=\"M40 185V95M100 185V45M160 185v-70M